                                "sense_id": "a17fdf60-1ee8-31be-b280-c05148acd341",
                                "text": "In an off-line editing session, an edit is often made longer than it will be in the final show. The following edit will usually erase the tail of such an edit. The erased portion of the edit is called an overrecord."
